And on Friday, I'm going to talk a little bit&nbsp;
more about the Republican strategy of doing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:24.240
culture war issues instead of policy. But what&nbsp;
I want to explain today is that the culture war&nbsp;&nbsp;

