taught in schools, but it certainly shouldn't&nbsp;
be banned. I'm not interested in going around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:43.520
extolling the endless virtues of critical&nbsp;
race theory, but it should be understood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:48.160
among many other ways of analyzing the&nbsp;
world around us what I'm interested in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:55.840
Is moving society on from the thought that&nbsp;
critical race theory is even an important issue,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.840 --> 00:10:00.720
that it should get the amount of oxygen that&nbsp;
it's getting. And so when I say the left is&nbsp;&nbsp;

