00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:26.160
The complexity is and here's where I turn to&nbsp;
you for ideas. The complexity is that if you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:31.040
just ignore these issues, if you ignore the war&nbsp;
on Christmas, you ignore the fact that the right&nbsp;&nbsp;

